2},{"text":"If both an argument in favor of and an argument against a measure have been selected for publication in the Sample","x":252,"y":643,"w":1971,"h":39},{"text":"Ballot & Official Voter Information Pamphlet, a typed rebuttal to the argument in favor of or the argument against the","x":250,"y":687,"w":1965,"h":39},{"text":"measure may be submitted as outlined in this form.","x":250,"y":731,"w":865,"h":37},{"text":"The author(s) of the primary argument of the measure may prepare and submit a rebuttal argument or may authorize","x":249,"y":805,"w":1975,"h":39},{"text":"in writing any other person or persons to prepare, submit or sign the rebuttal argument.","x":250,"y":850,"w":1466,"h":39},{"text":"A rebuttal argument will not be accepted unless accompanied by this completed form, which shall contain the printed","x":248,"y":923,"w":1973,"h":40},{"text":"name(s) and signature(s) of the person(s) submitting it or, if submitted on behalf of a bona fide association of citizens,","x":249,"y":967,"w":1984,"h":40},{"text":"the name of the association and the printed name and signature of at least one of its principal officers. Please make","x":248,"y":1011,"w":1974,"h":40},{"text":"sure you are using proper format before submitting to the Elections Office.","x":248,"y":1057,"w":1359,"h":39},{"text":"Word count limit for Rebuttal Arguments = 250 words","x":246,"y":1129,"w":900,"h":41},{"text":"Ballot Measure","x":248,"y":1206,"w":253,"h":33},{"text":"for the General Election","x":859,"y":1196,"w":407,"h":42},{"text":"C] Rebuttal to Argument in Favor of Measure","x":246,"y":1275,"w":777,"h":51},{"text":"11/3/2026","x":1750,"y":1197,"w":164,"h":30},{"text":"to be held on","x":1515,"y":1207,"w":219,"h":30},{"text":"Rebuttal to Argument Against Measure","x":1362,"y":1288,"w":654,"h":39},{"text":"Signed by Same Individual(s) Selected for the Voter Information Pamphlet for the Primary Argument","x":268,"y":1399,"w":1815,"h":39},{"text":"If the rebuttal argument is signed by the same individual(s) as those already selected for the Voter Information","x":269,"y":1492,"w":1856,"h":40},{"text":"Pamphlet for the primary argument, check the following box and skip the back side of this form.","x":268,"y":1536,"w":1612,"h":39},{"text":"n Rebuttal Argument Is Signed by Same Individual(s) Selected for the Voter Information Pamphlet for the","x":280,"y":1603,"w":1848,"h":40},{"text":"Primary Argument","x":388,"y":1648,"w":306,"h":38},{"text":"Contact Person's Printed Name:","x":386,"y":1704,"w":543,"h":32},{"text":"Phone:","x":387,"y":1846,"w":116,"h":30},{"text":"Email:","x":1248,"y":1847,"w":102,"h":30},{"text":"Signed by Different Individual(s) than Individual(s) Selected for the Voter Information Pamphlet for the","x":264,"y":1995,"w":1854,"h":41},{"text":"Primary Argument","x":264,"y":2041,"w":332,"h":37},{"text":"The author(s) of the primary argument may authorize any other person or persons to sign the rebuttal argument. If","x":262,"y":2104,"w":1943,"h":41},{"text":"signers are new for the rebuttal argument, please check the following box, complete the back side of this form and","x":263,"y":2148,"w":1927,"h":40},{"text":"attach the written authorization (the Authorization Form for Change in Signers of Rebuttal Argument) from the","x":263,"y":2192,"w":1848,"h":41},{"text":"primary argument author(s).","x":264,"y":2238,"w":470,"h":40},{"text":"Rebuttal Argument Is Signed by New Signers as Authorized by Primary Argument Author(s)","x":384,"y":2312,"w":1547,"h":40},{"text":"Contact Person's Printed Name:","x":382,"y":2380,"w":544,"h":30},{"text":"Jennifer Ellison","x":384,"y":2450,"w":258,"h":31},{"text":"Phone:","x":383,"y":2520,"w":116,"h":30},{"text":"Email:","x":1244,"y":2520,"w":102,"h":30},{"text":"Arguments will be emailed to the contact person listed here for review before they are printed in the Sample","x":255,"y":2683,"w":1964,"h":41},{"text":"Ballot & Official Voter Information Pamphlets.","x":823,"y":2728,"w":827,"h":38},{"text